= Friedrich Naumann

Friedrich Naumann is our current party chairman and one of the co-founders of the DDP. He is one of the most influential German Liberal intelectuals, and a protestant parish pastor. He is also our party's linksliberale wing's ideological father.
  
- @coalition_relations
- @strenghten_left_liberals
- @party_unity
- @root: Return to main
  
@coalition_relations
title: Improving relations with our coalition partners.
subtitle: Naumann can improve our relations with our coalition partners, and smooth over dissent.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and (in_weimar_coalition or in_grand_coalition or ddp_in_government)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if not ddp_in_government : We are not currently in government. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; coalition_dissent -= 1 if ddp_in_government = 1 and coalition_dissent > 0; z_relation += 6; spd_relation += 6; dvp_relation += 6; sammlung_dissent -= 3 if sammlung_dissent > 0; linksliberale_dissent -= 3

We have smoothed over tensions within the coalition, reassuring our partners of our commitment to stable government.
  
@strenghten_left_liberals
title: Strenghten the Linksliberale.
subtitle: Strenghten the left-liberal wing of our party.
view-if: difficulty < 1
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; linksliberale_strenght += 8; linksliberale_dissent -= 8

Naumann has strenghtened left-liberal ideas in the party.
  
@party_unity
title: Preserving party unity
subtitle: Use naumann's authority in the party to enforce discipline.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; sammlung_dissent -= 5; linksliberale_dissent -= 10; pazifisten_dissent -= 10; nationalliberale_dissent -= 10; republikschutzer_dissent -= 5

Friedrich Naumann has used his authority in the party to enforce party discipline. This has increased party unity.
